adr: ADR-1496, ADR-1498
evidence: Apple M4 Pro (macOS 26.6), macOS tester bundle built from 860050c3f, outside-tester report #2118 (docs/hardware-reports/2026-10-05-apple-m4-pro.json): the parity gate's metal cell, held exact at --precision max, is 0 on the Netflix 576x324 pair at 8 and 10 bit and both 1080p checkerboards (48 + 3 + 3 + 3 frames); test_metal_ssimulacra2_parity == on its 8 score cases (identical frames, lower third, large, odd and 10-bit frames). The executable then crashed in its 4:0:0 refusal case, a validation defect with no score involved (T-METAL-SSIMULACRA2-YUV400-ACCEPTED-2026-10-05).
